    "text": "Sold quietly at Toys \"R\" Us and similar stores in November 2011, in three versions, each a Stage 1 line with the Stage 1 in Cracked Ice holofoil: Vulpix and Ninetales from HeartGold & SoulSilver, Xatu from Unleashed, or Gliscor from Undaunted, with an Emerging Powers booster pack and an Emerging Powers sampling pack. The Ninetales and the Vulpix beside it were printed with the Undaunted expansion symbol instead of HeartGold & SoulSilver's, so every Cracked Ice Ninetales carries the wrong symbol.",
